        <section id="benchmarks" class="docs-section">
          <h2>Benchmarks</h2>
          <p>Criterion parser benchmark results on Apple Silicon M-series:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Plain text parsing: <strong>23.82 µs</strong></li>
            <li>SGR ANSI sequences: <strong>40.87 µs</strong></li>
            <li>Complex mixed output: <strong>23.41 µs</strong></li>
            <li>Idle CPU consumption: <strong>&lt;0.7%</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
